--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Observable Plot, by Observable, Inc.
https://github.com/observablehq/plot
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

fjader's mark API borrows from Observable Plot, though it is its own API and
not compatible with Plot's: mark names and channels, the shorthands that imply
stacking (x for x1/x2, y for y1/y2), the stackX/stackY conventions, z as the
series grouping channel, and many defaults.

fjader contains no code from Observable Plot; its license is included as a
courtesy. Observable Plot's license (ISC):

Copyright 2020-2025 Observable, Inc.

Permission to use, copy, modify, and/or distribute this software for any purpose
with or without fee is hereby granted, provided that the above copyright notice
and this permission notice appear in all copies.

THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS" AND THE AUTHOR DISCLAIMS ALL WARRANTIES WITH
REGARD TO THIS SOFTWARE INCLUDING ALL IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY AND
FITNESS. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHOR BE LIABLE FOR ANY SPECIAL, DIRECT,
