THIS SOFTWARE.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bundled dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Python package ships prebuilt JavaScript bundles that include third-party
packages, among them Svelte, d3, Flechette, mosaic-sql, Apache Arrow and
DuckDB-WASM. Each bundle sits next to a THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt listing every
package compiled into it, with its license in full. The npm package bundles
nothing: its dependencies install with their own licenses.
